<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian May wholesale prices down 0.5 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Austrian May wholesale prices down 0.5 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Central Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> AUSTRIAN WHOLESALE PRICES    May	 April	   May 96</p>
<p> Monthly WPI index rise	-0.1	  0.2	     0.6</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr inflation	    -0.5	  0.3	    -2.0</p>
<p> Index (base 1986)	    100.4	100.5	   105.4</p>
<p>NOTES -- previously announced data in brackets.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
